  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neo I Solar Power Plant, through CDM International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to OnePower Lesotho (Proprietary) Limited (&quot;OnePower&quot;) is supporting a feasibility study to evaluate the viability of a single solar photovoltaic (&quot;PV&quot;) inverter block as part of the larger 20-megawatt Neo I Solar PV plant and a local electrification plan in the Ts&apos;ana Talana council of Mafeteng District. The project is anticipated to be the first solar independent power production project in Lesotho. The U.S. firm CDM International, Inc. is completing the study, which will support One Power to address critical technical, financial and legal requirements to implement the power plant.</narrative>
  </description>
